        <p>
            I am a shepherd, not a gatekeeper. My goal is not to police this community but to
            protect it&mdash;so that the people who most need a safe space to ask their honest
            questions can find one here.
        </p>
        <p>
            These guidelines exist because I take seriously the responsibility of opening this
            door. Everyone who walks through it deserves to be treated with dignity. That includes
